1
00:00:00,030 --> 00:00:01,520
[Characters, behaviors, places, organizations,
professions, or events shown in the series

2
00:00:01,540 --> 00:00:02,820
are entirely fictional,
solely for the purpose of entertainment,

3
00:00:02,840 --> 00:00:03,990
with no intention to instruct
or promote any kind of behavior;

4
00:00:04,010 --> 00:00:05,010
viewer discretion is advised]

5
00:00:05,300 --> 00:00:06,490
I give you my word

6
00:00:06,900 --> 00:00:09,720
that I shall not brush
against your child, Madam Ratchapee,

7
00:00:10,200 --> 00:00:11,790
until you can be certain

8
00:00:12,010 --> 00:00:13,690
that my love is nothing but pure.

9
00:00:13,990 --> 00:00:16,800
Didn't you promise we'd walk
a long way together, hand in hand?

10
00:00:17,010 --> 00:00:19,560
Why are you leaving me
like this, my beloved?

11
00:00:22,700 --> 00:00:24,040
Peem! They're gonna blister, dear!

12
00:00:25,700 --> 00:00:27,900
If any merits I have made

13
00:00:27,920 --> 00:00:30,310
still remain,

14
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:34,300
may you take me back to Phop Phra.

15
00:00:35,710 --> 00:00:38,560
[Two months later]

16
00:00:42,200 --> 00:00:45,290
The doctor said that
you've started to become responsive

17
00:00:45,830 --> 00:00:48,200
over the past two to three days.

18
00:00:49,200 --> 00:00:51,490
You're not giving up, right, Phu?

19
00:00:52,410 --> 00:00:54,670
I won't give up either.

20
00:00:55,110 --> 00:00:57,610
I intend to live my normal life

21
00:00:58,520 --> 00:01:01,200
as the same old Lieutenant Peem.

22
00:01:01,800 --> 00:01:04,120
Whatever wears me down,

23
00:01:04,710 --> 00:01:07,190
I promise I will ignore it all.

24
00:01:07,500 --> 00:01:10,080
My only duty right now

25
00:01:11,400 --> 00:01:13,300
is to live my life

26
00:01:14,410 --> 00:01:15,990
and be patient

27
00:01:16,190 --> 00:01:19,920
until it's time for me to be with her again.

28
00:01:22,110 --> 00:01:24,420
Wake up soon, Phu.

29
00:01:26,400 --> 00:01:29,740
There's someone
I want to introduce to you.

30
00:02:36,810 --> 00:02:37,810
Peem.

31
00:02:39,100 --> 00:02:41,040
Stop doing this to me.

32
00:02:42,310 --> 00:02:44,160
Tell me what you want.

33
00:02:45,010 --> 00:02:46,350
You think

34
00:02:46,360 --> 00:02:48,680
I'm back to normal, right?

35
00:02:49,490 --> 00:02:50,920
Of course, I do!

36
00:02:51,100 --> 00:02:52,240
So what?

37
00:02:53,110 --> 00:02:55,880
Are you saying you've been fine all along,

38
00:02:56,510 --> 00:02:58,840
even when you starved yourself

39
00:02:58,870 --> 00:02:59,800
and let yourself rot

40
00:02:59,810 --> 00:03:02,120
like a zombie for a month?

41
00:03:03,610 --> 00:03:05,880
The reason you've gotten better

42
00:03:06,520 --> 00:03:08,180
is because...

43
00:03:08,200 --> 00:03:11,350
you've spent some time away
from that woman.

44
00:03:15,850 --> 00:03:18,800
This is the last time I'm telling you that

45
00:03:19,010 --> 00:03:20,760
I've never been cursed with black magic,

46
00:03:21,610 --> 00:03:23,600
nor has she ever wished ill upon me.

47
00:03:26,070 --> 00:03:28,150
And if something's still bugging you

48
00:03:28,160 --> 00:03:29,320
about this whole thing,

49
00:03:29,340 --> 00:03:30,890
or if you have anything more to prove,

50
00:03:30,900 --> 00:03:32,000
be my guest.

51
00:03:32,220 --> 00:03:33,600
But I would like to tell you

52
00:03:33,610 --> 00:03:35,960
that this will be the end of it

53
00:03:36,510 --> 00:03:37,380
because...

54
00:03:37,390 --> 00:03:39,800
I will prove nothing more to you.

55
00:03:40,300 --> 00:03:41,600
What if I don't let this end?

56
00:03:44,200 --> 00:03:45,900
Then just take it as if...

57
00:03:46,400 --> 00:03:48,810
I'm dead to you.

58
00:03:50,390 --> 00:03:51,280
Peem,

59
00:03:51,300 --> 00:03:53,280
why would you say that?!

60
00:04:33,810 --> 00:04:35,370
I know...

61
00:04:35,380 --> 00:04:37,800
how I could help you, dear.

62
00:04:59,200 --> 00:05:03,490
♫Along with ghostly spirits
hounding relentlessly,♫

63
00:05:03,510 --> 00:05:08,100
♫May the maras be ravaged
and perish completely♫

64
00:05:08,110 --> 00:05:12,370
♫Vindictive spirits, tyrannical psyches,♫

65
00:05:12,390 --> 00:05:16,760
♫Meant to betray, slaughter, and invade,♫

66
00:05:16,780 --> 00:05:21,170
♫Were any souls to brush
against my karmic soulmate,♫

67
00:05:21,190 --> 00:05:25,690
♫They shall bury the thought
of returning to their realm♫

68
00:05:25,710 --> 00:05:29,790
♫With incantation and virtue as shield,♫

69
00:05:29,810 --> 00:05:34,270
♫At my feet,
they shall surrender and kneel,♫

70
00:05:34,280 --> 00:05:40,410
♫Chanting, "Sadhu," of their own will♫

71
00:06:04,520 --> 00:06:05,520
You...

72
00:06:06,210 --> 00:06:08,680
You have foul magic running through you.

73
00:06:08,810 --> 00:06:11,410
It is filthy and evil.

74
00:06:11,810 --> 00:06:13,210
It will wreak havoc on you

75
00:06:13,590 --> 00:06:15,960
and your family.

76
00:06:16,200 --> 00:06:17,290
Grandmaster,

77
00:06:17,310 --> 00:06:18,560
what do we have to do?

78
00:06:18,720 --> 00:06:19,680
I will perform a ritual

79
00:06:19,900 --> 00:06:21,720
to exorcise a wicked spirit from your daughter.

80
00:06:27,000 --> 00:06:28,090
Ghost-banishing rattan cane.

81
00:06:29,110 --> 00:06:31,600
I will beat the ghost
out of your daughter.

82
00:06:41,290 --> 00:06:42,680
This evil spirit

83
00:06:42,700 --> 00:06:43,960
possesses immense strength.

84
00:06:44,190 --> 00:06:46,280
Is there any other way
to exorcise it, Grandmaster?

85
00:06:46,730 --> 00:06:47,940
This is no daughter of yours.

86
00:06:48,700 --> 00:06:51,570
I am forcing this ghost to reveal itself.

87
00:06:52,320 --> 00:06:53,500
What do you say?

88
00:06:54,160 --> 00:06:56,560
Do you agree to let me
exorcise it from your daughter?

89
00:07:07,310 --> 00:07:08,480
Mom,

90
00:07:12,100 --> 00:07:14,490
if I agree to let

91
00:07:16,390 --> 00:07:18,310
a phony exorcist

92
00:07:18,600 --> 00:07:20,980
perform an exorcism on me this time,

93
00:07:24,230 --> 00:07:26,400
you will believe me

94
00:07:28,210 --> 00:07:30,980
that my feelings from now on

95
00:07:32,000 --> 00:07:34,300
are genuine

96
00:07:36,000 --> 00:07:38,140
and that I'm not
possessed by anything, right?

97
00:08:10,610 --> 00:08:12,000
Leave, you evil spirit!

98
00:08:45,910 --> 00:08:47,320
Peem, my dear grandbaby.

99
00:08:47,330 --> 00:08:48,370
Peem...

100
00:08:50,500 --> 00:08:52,600
What's going on, huh?

101
00:08:57,330 --> 00:08:58,480
What is this, dear?

102
00:09:00,790 --> 00:09:02,230
What happened to you?

103
00:09:02,400 --> 00:09:03,680
Let me see.

104
00:09:05,420 --> 00:09:06,480
Peem!

105
00:09:07,900 --> 00:09:09,720
What happened to you, dear?!

106
00:09:10,620 --> 00:09:11,780
What happened, dear?

107
00:09:12,990 --> 00:09:13,680
What went on?!

108
00:09:13,690 --> 00:09:15,930
Tell me what went on, dear!

109
00:09:17,220 --> 00:09:18,220
Huh?

110
00:09:21,920 --> 00:09:23,000
Don't touch her!

111
00:09:25,110 --> 00:09:26,720
This has gone too far.

112
00:09:28,010 --> 00:09:29,800
All these years,
I've raised my granddaughter

113
00:09:30,800 --> 00:09:33,480
and kept her safe from every little harm.

114
00:09:34,410 --> 00:09:37,010
What kind of despicable mother are you?!

115
00:09:37,510 --> 00:09:41,320
Did you hand over your own flesh
and blood just to let someone hurt her?!

116
00:09:42,010 --> 00:09:44,120
All this time, I've never stopped you
from doing whatever you wanted

117
00:09:44,360 --> 00:09:45,620
if it gave you peace of mind,

118
00:09:45,640 --> 00:09:47,670
but doing this
to your daughter is taking it way too far!

119
00:09:51,000 --> 00:09:53,000
Ask yourself, huh?

120
00:09:53,200 --> 00:09:55,300
Ask yourself
how out of your mind you've become.

121
00:09:55,320 --> 00:09:56,550
Are you even still human?!

122
00:09:56,560 --> 00:09:57,440
Tell me, huh?

123
00:09:57,450 --> 00:09:59,200
You're too far gone!

124
00:10:02,610 --> 00:10:04,510
I miss my old mom,

125
00:10:07,910 --> 00:10:11,280
the mom who put
her three children's happiness first.

126
00:10:15,110 --> 00:10:17,300
I don't understand

127
00:10:18,900 --> 00:10:21,680
what could have made
you change so drastically.

128
00:10:24,800 --> 00:10:28,300
If anyone in this house is possessed,

129
00:10:30,000 --> 00:10:31,600
I don't think it's anyone

130
00:10:32,900 --> 00:10:34,240
but you, Mom.

131
00:10:46,320 --> 00:10:47,200
Peem...

132
00:11:12,410 --> 00:11:14,240
I'm begging you, Pat.

133
00:11:15,700 --> 00:11:17,520
Do not take him with you.

134
00:11:19,400 --> 00:11:21,410
Please let Phu stay with me.

135
00:11:21,680 --> 00:11:25,000
[Pichapat Ruechakun]

136
00:11:51,160 --> 00:11:53,400
By the power of all sacred beings

137
00:11:54,410 --> 00:11:58,300
and the merits I have accumulated
throughout my past

138
00:11:58,920 --> 00:12:00,410
and present lives,

139
00:12:02,110 --> 00:12:04,900
may you all

140
00:12:05,720 --> 00:12:09,600
drive out all evil residing within my body,

141
00:12:10,100 --> 00:12:11,960
as well as my mother's.

142
00:12:30,600 --> 00:12:31,840
Darling...

143
00:12:32,800 --> 00:12:33,840
Mom...

144
00:12:34,420 --> 00:12:35,800
please help me.

145
00:12:43,810 --> 00:12:48,510
"This incantation shall help Mrs. Ratchapee
return to her usual self."

146
00:13:12,700 --> 00:13:14,410
Does it hurt badly, my dear?

147
00:13:27,000 --> 00:13:28,000
Peem...

148
00:13:29,420 --> 00:13:31,110
please listen to me.

149
00:13:33,010 --> 00:13:34,200
I'm sorry.

150
00:13:36,110 --> 00:13:38,580
I'm sorry for everything I've done.

151
00:13:41,200 --> 00:13:44,410
I should have been
the happiest person in the world,

152
00:13:45,210 --> 00:13:47,120
seeing you happy

153
00:13:49,050 --> 00:13:50,500
with someone you love

154
00:13:51,200 --> 00:13:52,900
who loves you back.

155
00:13:54,500 --> 00:13:56,500
I have no idea what kind of wicked spirit

156
00:13:56,510 --> 00:13:58,110
possessed me,

157
00:13:58,810 --> 00:14:01,000
forcing me to do all those things to you.

158
00:14:04,300 --> 00:14:06,320
You must already hate me.

159
00:14:08,200 --> 00:14:10,790
I haven't been acting
like a mother to you at all.

160
00:14:22,490 --> 00:14:23,560
No,

161
00:14:24,490 --> 00:14:26,620
I've never hated you.

162
00:14:28,820 --> 00:14:30,210
Not even once.

163
00:14:33,110 --> 00:14:34,720
I'm sorry, Peem,

164
00:14:35,310 --> 00:14:38,210
for being the reason
everything turned out this way.

165
00:14:38,480 --> 00:14:39,760
Please forgive me.

166
00:14:39,780 --> 00:14:41,280
I really didn't mean it.

167
00:14:42,200 --> 00:14:45,100
I never wanted it
to turn out like this, Peem.

168
00:14:45,640 --> 00:14:47,800
I'm sorry, Peem.

169
00:14:55,690 --> 00:14:57,290
I'm sorry...

170
00:15:00,510 --> 00:15:02,680
It's alright, Mom.

171
00:15:06,420 --> 00:15:09,110
Don't apologize to me anymore.

172
00:15:10,910 --> 00:15:13,090
Because I want

173
00:15:13,810 --> 00:15:15,500
nothing more than

174
00:15:17,900 --> 00:15:21,590
for my old mother to finally come back.

175
00:15:22,500 --> 00:15:24,410
I'm back, Peem.

176
00:15:25,340 --> 00:15:27,110
I'm back.

177
00:15:42,590 --> 00:15:43,900
So that means...

178
00:15:45,210 --> 00:15:47,920
you already accepted Master Bulan?

179
00:15:53,300 --> 00:15:55,000
Whoever my daughter loves,

180
00:15:56,200 --> 00:15:57,790
I will also love.

181
00:16:04,300 --> 00:16:05,510
Then...

182
00:16:06,910 --> 00:16:09,040
may I go see her?

183
00:16:14,090 --> 00:16:15,850
I miss her.

184
00:16:17,220 --> 00:16:19,110
I really miss her, Mom.

185
00:16:20,790 --> 00:16:22,610
But the wounds on your back...

186
00:16:23,910 --> 00:16:25,320
I'm fine, Mom.

187
00:16:25,900 --> 00:16:27,600
It doesn't hurt too bad.

188
00:16:30,210 --> 00:16:31,490
Please, Mom?

189
00:16:32,670 --> 00:16:34,620
Please let me go see her.

190
00:16:50,800 --> 00:16:54,710
[Phop Phra]

191
00:16:59,200 --> 00:17:00,130
Wait for me, my beloved.

192
00:17:00,600 --> 00:17:01,940
I'm on my way to you.

193
00:18:00,810 --> 00:18:02,420
I received a report last night

194
00:18:03,410 --> 00:18:04,800
that a car swerved off the road.

195
00:18:05,230 --> 00:18:06,790
At first, I didn't think too much of it,

196
00:18:07,200 --> 00:18:09,300
but they said it was Lieutenant Peem's car,

197
00:18:09,690 --> 00:18:10,690
so I went to check.

198
00:18:11,390 --> 00:18:12,890
The trucker gave a statement,

199
00:18:13,020 --> 00:18:15,680
saying that her car
crossed into their lane,

200
00:18:15,700 --> 00:18:16,790
so the driver veered off to avoid it.

201
00:18:17,010 --> 00:18:18,710
That's how her car ended up off the road.

202
00:18:18,930 --> 00:18:20,500
Good thing she has no major injuries.

203
00:18:20,670 --> 00:18:22,110
And how is the lieutenant holding up?

204
00:18:22,130 --> 00:18:23,390
She hasn't regained consciousness yet.

205
00:19:25,200 --> 00:19:27,280
From this day forth,
whatever may happen,

206
00:19:28,500 --> 00:19:30,620
I shall linger by your side.

207
00:19:31,960 --> 00:19:33,470
Even when I am not there in flesh...

208
00:19:35,550 --> 00:19:37,200
I shall remain with my love.

209
00:20:30,510 --> 00:20:31,240
Hello.

210
00:20:31,800 --> 00:20:32,820
Hello, Chief.

211
00:20:34,220 --> 00:20:35,610
I am Sergeant Piak.

212
00:20:38,210 --> 00:20:40,400
Peem told me about you, Sergeant Piak.

213
00:20:40,830 --> 00:20:42,840
Thank you so much for taking care of her.

214
00:20:43,300 --> 00:20:44,300
With pleasure, ma'am.

215
00:20:45,320 --> 00:20:46,150
Alright.

216
00:21:03,900 --> 00:21:06,280
Pray you, go and tend
to your elder sister.

217
00:21:12,610 --> 00:21:14,260
Do not beseech me as though

218
00:21:14,270 --> 00:21:16,270
I have the heart
of a vicious being, dear Pat.

219
00:21:17,320 --> 00:21:19,090
Come what may,

220
00:21:19,310 --> 00:21:22,190
I shall not break my own oath.

221
00:21:24,300 --> 00:21:25,300
Dear Pat,

222
00:21:25,570 --> 00:21:27,880
do not squander
your time right here with me.

223
00:21:28,310 --> 00:21:31,900
Hurry along to seek
the spirit of your beloved elder sister

224
00:21:32,100 --> 00:21:33,620
before the ship has sailed.

225
00:21:38,700 --> 00:21:41,580
She was born with the charm of metta.

226
00:21:42,270 --> 00:21:44,250
This shall aid you, dear Pat.

227
00:21:45,540 --> 00:21:48,700
Not only will you save
your elder sister's life,

228
00:21:50,100 --> 00:21:53,200
but you will also breathe life
into your family,

229
00:21:54,200 --> 00:21:56,100
those you cherish.

230
00:21:58,450 --> 00:22:00,510
Let there be no more losses.

231
00:22:09,120 --> 00:22:11,090
Dear vital spirits,

232
00:22:11,690 --> 00:22:14,690
wherever you may be, may you return

233
00:22:15,810 --> 00:22:17,600
to my dearest karmic soulmate.

234
00:22:22,500 --> 00:22:24,010
My heart...

235
00:22:24,250 --> 00:22:27,100
feels as though
it is about to be torn apart.

236
00:22:53,920 --> 00:22:55,900
Wasn't I already here?

237
00:23:19,420 --> 00:23:20,920
Go get the doctor!

238
00:23:47,900 --> 00:23:49,190
Have you finally come,

239
00:23:49,710 --> 00:23:50,900
my dear little sister?

240
00:24:07,810 --> 00:24:10,290
Dare you set foot
upon Father's sanctum?

241
00:24:12,100 --> 00:24:13,530
So where is it, my dear little sister,

242
00:24:15,230 --> 00:24:17,490
Father's sorcerous tiger?

243
00:24:19,190 --> 00:24:20,490
Why do you never

244
00:24:21,810 --> 00:24:23,980
let me lay eyes upon it?

245
00:24:24,600 --> 00:24:27,400
The family's arts
are meant to serve as a shield,

246
00:24:27,420 --> 00:24:29,030
not for mere display.

247
00:24:29,410 --> 00:24:30,810
A shield, huh?

248
00:24:40,710 --> 00:24:42,300
And whom could you ever shield?

249
00:24:43,810 --> 00:24:46,100
Entangling innocent souls in this ordeal,

250
00:24:46,720 --> 00:24:48,380
you are nothing but vermin, Zai.

251
00:24:48,390 --> 00:24:49,990
I am capable of even more.

252
00:24:51,810 --> 00:24:53,120
I can even commit

253
00:24:53,300 --> 00:24:54,890
the sin of matricide

254
00:24:55,420 --> 00:24:56,640
against the nun!

255
00:24:57,200 --> 00:24:58,300
You damn ungrateful wretch.

256
00:24:58,330 --> 00:24:59,600
That is your own mother.

257
00:25:03,210 --> 00:25:04,500
Someone like yourself

258
00:25:04,520 --> 00:25:06,110
cannot be saved.

259
00:25:10,190 --> 00:25:11,710
From now on,

260
00:25:12,210 --> 00:25:14,480
you are no damn elder brother of mine!

261
00:25:23,110 --> 00:25:24,800
Should you wish to witness it,

262
00:25:24,810 --> 00:25:26,510
I shall oblige.

263
00:25:30,220 --> 00:25:35,200
(Incanting)

264
00:25:49,610 --> 00:25:51,800
Father's sorcerous tiger...

265
00:25:58,490 --> 00:26:00,110
truly was bequeathed to you.

266
00:26:05,110 --> 00:26:05,980
Go!

267
00:26:16,300 --> 00:26:17,710
Know you not

268
00:26:19,800 --> 00:26:21,110
that the sorcerous tiger...

269
00:26:22,520 --> 00:26:24,400
does not harm those of its own family?

270
00:26:29,600 --> 00:26:31,200
What a shame

271
00:26:33,900 --> 00:26:36,700
that Father bequeathed
the arts of the sorcerous tiger to you.

272
00:26:38,700 --> 00:26:40,120
Since time immemorial,

273
00:26:41,320 --> 00:26:43,400
you have always had everything,

274
00:26:47,500 --> 00:26:48,500
unlike me.

275
00:26:52,400 --> 00:26:54,290
No matter how hard I persevered,

276
00:26:55,120 --> 00:26:56,580
no matter what I did,

277
00:26:58,210 --> 00:27:00,490
Father never once grew fond of me.

278
00:27:03,490 --> 00:27:04,800
You are the golden child.

279
00:27:07,510 --> 00:27:09,010
You did nothing,

280
00:27:10,510 --> 00:27:12,410
yet Father almost
bequeathed everything to you.

281
00:27:14,110 --> 00:27:15,110
Now,

282
00:27:16,890 --> 00:27:19,410
I shall make you know the meaning of loss.

283
00:27:21,810 --> 00:27:22,910
My dear little sister,

284
00:27:24,520 --> 00:27:26,390
do relinquish the arts

285
00:27:26,700 --> 00:27:28,000
within you

286
00:27:30,090 --> 00:27:31,910
and bestow them upon me,

287
00:27:35,300 --> 00:27:37,200
and I shall let everyone live.

288
00:27:39,790 --> 00:27:41,400
Should you so much as think to resist,

289
00:27:42,300 --> 00:27:44,020
I shall shatter

290
00:27:44,720 --> 00:27:47,790
and destroy that girl's soul completely.

291
00:27:51,700 --> 00:27:53,180
Let us see

292
00:27:53,800 --> 00:27:55,200
how shattered

293
00:27:56,010 --> 00:27:57,810
your karmic soulmate can become.

294
00:27:58,700 --> 00:27:59,700
This

295
00:27:59,980 --> 00:28:02,100
is between you and me!

296
00:28:02,710 --> 00:28:05,210
Should your karmic soulmate
be rid of the charm of metta,

297
00:28:06,000 --> 00:28:09,000
she cannot enhance your virtues
as Father proclaimed.

298
00:28:11,710 --> 00:28:12,810
Do you scheme

299
00:28:13,000 --> 00:28:14,300
to shatter her

300
00:28:15,500 --> 00:28:17,110
just so you can destroy me?

301
00:28:23,010 --> 00:28:24,210
It seems

302
00:28:24,600 --> 00:28:27,800
you and I cannot
simply breathe in the same realm.

303
00:28:29,800 --> 00:28:31,690
Your final moments...

304
00:28:32,410 --> 00:28:33,700
began to unfold

305
00:28:34,710 --> 00:28:37,290
the very moment you
brushed against my karmic soulmate!

306
00:28:37,310 --> 00:28:38,990
No, these are your final moments.

307
00:28:40,210 --> 00:28:41,470
This instant,

308
00:28:41,490 --> 00:28:42,590
Bulan, you wretch,

309
00:28:43,520 --> 00:28:45,300
only your name shall remain.

310
00:29:29,800 --> 00:29:31,200
Peem...

311
00:29:38,020 --> 00:29:38,910
Pat...

312
00:29:47,510 --> 00:29:48,410
How...

313
00:29:48,820 --> 00:29:50,590
did you find me?

314
00:29:54,100 --> 00:29:56,690
A golden light called me here.

315
00:29:57,300 --> 00:30:00,490
I think it's called "the charm of metta."

316
00:30:01,600 --> 00:30:04,000
Your karmic soulmate
was the one who told me about it.

317
00:30:16,010 --> 00:30:18,910
Miss Pichapat Ruechakun,

318
00:30:19,200 --> 00:30:21,010
pray you, come and receive the merit

319
00:30:21,200 --> 00:30:23,690
I am dedicating to you today.

320
00:30:28,510 --> 00:30:30,180
She has been making merit
and offering alms,

321
00:30:30,210 --> 00:30:32,490
dedicating them to me every time

322
00:30:33,110 --> 00:30:36,300
and giving me enough strength to help you.

323
00:30:43,000 --> 00:30:44,610
It's Master Bulan,

324
00:30:44,960 --> 00:30:46,800
my love.

325
00:30:49,600 --> 00:30:51,890
Thank her on my behalf, Peem.

326
00:30:52,010 --> 00:30:53,300
And...

327
00:30:53,710 --> 00:30:56,110
thank you and Phu both

328
00:30:56,410 --> 00:30:58,500
for everything you've always done for me.

329
00:30:59,490 --> 00:31:00,720
But right now,

330
00:31:00,910 --> 00:31:02,870
it's time for me to do something

331
00:31:02,890 --> 00:31:04,190
for both your sakes.

332
00:31:09,020 --> 00:31:10,710
Trust me, alright?

333
00:32:06,100 --> 00:32:07,800
Your vital spirits

334
00:32:07,820 --> 00:32:10,500
are incarcerated
by the power of the dark arts.

335
00:32:11,100 --> 00:32:13,300
Before this,
he had obtained your date of birth,

336
00:32:13,320 --> 00:32:14,870
shards of your elemental mediums,

337
00:32:14,880 --> 00:32:16,230
your personal belongings,

338
00:32:16,800 --> 00:32:19,220
and soil from beneath your feet.

339
00:32:19,510 --> 00:32:21,490
But he couldn't cast black magic on you

340
00:32:21,500 --> 00:32:23,660
because you were protected
by the charm of metta,

341
00:32:24,300 --> 00:32:27,780
so he used Mom
to slowly weaken its power.

342
00:32:27,800 --> 00:32:29,890
Eventually, he was able to
steal all of your vital spirits

343
00:32:29,910 --> 00:32:31,500
when you got into an accident.

344
00:32:36,210 --> 00:32:37,910
So what do I have to do, Pat?

345
00:32:38,500 --> 00:32:39,990
We have to get you out of here

346
00:32:40,010 --> 00:32:42,000
by setting your vital spirits free.

347
00:32:46,010 --> 00:32:47,540
So that means...

348
00:32:47,910 --> 00:32:50,110
all I have to do
is pull off those damn ropes?

349
00:32:53,790 --> 00:32:55,510
Come on. Let's do it, then.

350
00:33:02,700 --> 00:33:03,700
What's the matter, Pat?

351
00:33:04,610 --> 00:33:06,210
I have to go now.

352
00:33:08,010 --> 00:33:09,010
Go where?

353
00:33:10,190 --> 00:33:12,790
Peem, you have to hurry back.

354
00:33:13,010 --> 00:33:14,600
Everything has its time.

355
00:33:32,910 --> 00:33:34,500
I'm sorry, Pat.

356
00:33:35,320 --> 00:33:36,320
I...

357
00:33:37,100 --> 00:33:39,110
couldn't protect you.

358
00:33:43,810 --> 00:33:46,310
Stop blaming yourself

359
00:33:47,610 --> 00:33:50,130
for what happened to me.

360
00:33:59,700 --> 00:34:00,800
No, Pat.

361
00:34:00,900 --> 00:34:02,390
I don't wanna go back just yet.

362
00:34:02,990 --> 00:34:04,850
I still want to stay here with you.

363
00:34:05,830 --> 00:34:07,600
That can't be, Peem.

364
00:34:07,800 --> 00:34:09,510
Everyone's waiting for you.

365
00:34:10,500 --> 00:34:11,790
Mom,

366
00:34:12,220 --> 00:34:13,620
Dad,

367
00:34:14,000 --> 00:34:15,300
Grandma,

368
00:34:16,290 --> 00:34:17,710
Phu,

369
00:34:18,810 --> 00:34:19,890
and...

370
00:34:20,820 --> 00:34:23,200
your karmic soulmate,
who's waited for you for so long.

371
00:34:23,490 --> 00:34:25,300
Don't keep her waiting any longer.

372
00:34:30,020 --> 00:34:31,200
No matter what,

373
00:34:31,380 --> 00:34:33,220
we'll meet again one day.

374
00:34:33,710 --> 00:34:35,700
You don't have to rush being with me.

375
00:34:40,410 --> 00:34:41,900
I promise

376
00:34:42,200 --> 00:34:44,330
I will find Phu at all costs,

377
00:34:44,510 --> 00:34:46,380
no matter how hard it gets.

378
00:34:53,320 --> 00:34:55,310
Good luck, Peem.

379
00:34:55,610 --> 00:34:58,360
May you live a happy life from now on.

380
00:35:37,390 --> 00:35:39,100
Good luck, Pat.

381
00:35:58,900 --> 00:36:01,070
Peem!

382
00:36:01,090 --> 00:36:02,270
Peem, you're awake!

383
00:36:02,690 --> 00:36:03,630
- Peem...
- Lieutenant?

384
00:36:03,660 --> 00:36:04,940
Peem, you're awake!

385
00:36:14,790 --> 00:36:17,020
Didn't Master Bulan come?

386
00:36:18,290 --> 00:36:20,110
She didn't, my dear.

387
00:36:21,110 --> 00:36:22,530
But it's alright.

388
00:36:23,560 --> 00:36:25,180
Once you're fully recovered,

389
00:36:25,200 --> 00:36:26,760
we'll go see her together.

390
00:36:28,800 --> 00:36:30,870
Actually, I came here with her,

391
00:36:35,420 --> 00:36:36,110
but...

392
00:36:36,300 --> 00:36:38,600
when I opened the door
to see you and your family,

393
00:36:39,000 --> 00:36:40,400
she was no longer here.

394
00:36:44,510 --> 00:36:45,680
Master...

395
00:36:45,700 --> 00:36:47,720
is a woman of her word

396
00:36:48,220 --> 00:36:50,280
because she said

397
00:36:50,300 --> 00:36:52,480
she'd never come see you again

398
00:36:53,300 --> 00:36:57,310
until your mother accepts her.

399
00:36:58,800 --> 00:37:01,220
She would never break her oath.

400
00:37:05,600 --> 00:37:06,600
Thong...

401
00:37:08,420 --> 00:37:09,420
Peem?

402
00:37:11,400 --> 00:37:12,400
Thong...

403
00:37:14,100 --> 00:37:15,310
Mom?

404
00:37:17,030 --> 00:37:18,030
Thong...

405
00:37:21,410 --> 00:37:23,330
Where's your mommy?

406
00:37:24,290 --> 00:37:26,580
Why didn't she come to see me?

407
00:37:36,640 --> 00:37:38,480
Mom, please help Mommy.

408
00:37:38,500 --> 00:37:40,920
Mommy is vanquishing
Master Zai at the sanctum.

409
00:37:41,220 --> 00:37:43,900
Even though her arts are powerful,

410
00:37:43,920 --> 00:37:45,700
I am afraid

411
00:37:45,720 --> 00:37:47,750
his trickery will put her in danger.

412
00:37:49,300 --> 00:37:50,400
I'll be there right now.

413
00:37:51,010 --> 00:37:52,520
- Peem, what are you doing?
- Peem!

414
00:37:52,540 --> 00:37:53,510
- Peem, Peem!
- Lieutenant, Lieutenant, Lieutenant.

415
00:37:53,530 --> 00:37:54,170
- Peem!
- Peem!

416
00:37:54,180 --> 00:37:55,190
- Peem!
- Lieutenant, Lieutenant!

417
00:37:55,200 --> 00:37:56,770
- Calm down, Lieutenant.
- Peem!

418
00:37:56,790 --> 00:37:58,580
- She's in danger, Dad.
- Lieutenant.

419
00:37:58,600 --> 00:37:59,920
I have to help her.

420
00:37:59,940 --> 00:38:01,880
- Peem, please don't go.
- Don't... You can't go, dear.

421
00:38:01,900 --> 00:38:03,900
- You're still hurt!
- Lieutenant, calm down.

422
00:38:03,920 --> 00:38:04,770
- Peem.
- Lieutenant.

423
00:38:04,790 --> 00:38:06,270
It's dangerous, Peem.

424
00:38:06,410 --> 00:38:10,030
Listen, we'll have Sergeant Piak
and the other officers help her!

425
00:38:11,110 --> 00:38:12,390
No, Mom.

426
00:38:13,720 --> 00:38:16,010
The only one who can save Bulan

427
00:38:16,030 --> 00:38:17,920
is me, Mom.

428
00:38:20,490 --> 00:38:21,490
I'm going.

429
00:38:21,520 --> 00:38:22,660
- Sarge...
- Lieutenant, calm down.

430
00:38:22,690 --> 00:38:24,200
- Take me to her.
- Don't!

431
00:38:24,210 --> 00:38:25,450
Lieutenant, no.

432
00:38:25,460 --> 00:38:26,380
Please don't, Lieutenant.

433
00:38:35,090 --> 00:38:36,410
Grandma,

434
00:38:38,200 --> 00:38:40,920
I really can't live without her.

435
00:38:42,590 --> 00:38:44,510
Do you understand me?

436
00:38:45,810 --> 00:38:47,720
I'm begging you, Grandma.

437
00:38:48,320 --> 00:38:49,000
Please...

438
00:38:49,590 --> 00:38:51,570
I understand you, Peem.

439
00:38:52,290 --> 00:38:53,290
Peem...

440
00:38:53,320 --> 00:38:54,730
listen to me.

441
00:38:55,120 --> 00:38:57,020
You have to recover here first.

442
00:38:58,640 --> 00:39:00,580
The Master will be alright, dear.

443
00:39:00,590 --> 00:39:02,310
She will definitely be alright.

444
00:39:02,600 --> 00:39:03,990
I'm on my knees.

445
00:39:04,110 --> 00:39:05,900
Peem, Peem...

446
00:39:05,910 --> 00:39:08,190
- Peem...
- May I go to her, Mom?

447
00:39:09,620 --> 00:39:10,570
I really can't live

448
00:39:10,580 --> 00:39:12,020
- without her, Mom.
- Peem!

449
00:39:12,030 --> 00:39:13,850
- Peem...
- Peem!

450
00:39:13,880 --> 00:39:15,300
- Just tell me
- Peem...

451
00:39:15,310 --> 00:39:16,960
however many times you want me to beg.

452
00:39:16,970 --> 00:39:17,840
Peem...

453
00:39:18,280 --> 00:39:19,080
Peem...

454
00:39:19,220 --> 00:39:21,040
- I really can't live without her, Mom.
- Peem!

455
00:39:21,060 --> 00:39:22,670
I'm sorry, dear.

456
00:39:23,190 --> 00:39:25,500
I really can't let you.

457
00:39:25,520 --> 00:39:28,010
I love you, dear. Don't go...

458
00:39:28,120 --> 00:39:29,620
I'm sorry...

459
00:39:31,700 --> 00:39:33,190
Peem...

460
00:39:51,420 --> 00:39:53,400
Om, arise by my command.

461
00:39:53,420 --> 00:39:54,550
Arise in your entirety.

462
00:39:54,570 --> 00:39:55,770
Arise by the sacred incantation.

463
00:39:55,790 --> 00:39:57,510
Arise by the chant.

464
00:39:57,530 --> 00:39:59,200
Bound by the sacred verse.

465
00:40:22,620 --> 00:40:24,200
Master was not mistaken.

466
00:40:24,510 --> 00:40:26,890
One day, you would succumb to
the dark arts,

467
00:40:27,310 --> 00:40:30,390
return, and act like a despicable fiend.

468
00:40:33,800 --> 00:40:35,120
It is no wonder

469
00:40:35,600 --> 00:40:37,880
the late master
withheld his teachings from you.

470
00:40:43,620 --> 00:40:45,590
He was never mistaken, you say?

471
00:40:47,690 --> 00:40:48,760
You.

472
00:40:49,610 --> 00:40:51,400
You truly know him inside out, do you not?

473
00:40:52,800 --> 00:40:54,040
What a pity

474
00:40:57,040 --> 00:40:59,040
he is not here to witness

475
00:41:01,710 --> 00:41:04,280
how the very sacred arts he bestowed upon you

476
00:41:06,260 --> 00:41:08,320
became utterly worthless in your hands.

477
00:41:13,110 --> 00:41:14,720
His sacred arts

478
00:41:16,210 --> 00:41:17,790
belong to me.

479
00:41:24,600 --> 00:41:26,100
I am eager to see

480
00:41:28,000 --> 00:41:29,690
how long his grace

481
00:41:30,110 --> 00:41:32,070
can protect you from me.

482
00:41:43,710 --> 00:41:44,710
Peem...

483
00:41:46,120 --> 00:41:47,200
My dearest.

484
00:41:48,110 --> 00:41:52,490
"I had Sergeant wait for you
at the back entrance of the hospital."

485
00:41:53,810 --> 00:41:55,680
Follow the path.

486
00:41:56,610 --> 00:41:58,520
As for your parents,

487
00:41:58,540 --> 00:42:00,120
I'll look after them on your behalf.

488
00:42:01,200 --> 00:42:02,320
Go forth, dear.

489
00:42:03,990 --> 00:42:06,990
Go and aid your karmic soulmate.

490
00:42:07,800 --> 00:42:08,890
Thank you, Grandma.

491
00:42:08,910 --> 00:42:09,910
Yes, dear.

492
00:42:16,000 --> 00:42:17,020
Thank you

493
00:42:17,030 --> 00:42:19,000
for lending me a hand, Sarge.

494
00:42:19,730 --> 00:42:21,520
Yes, boss. With pleasure.

495
00:42:26,790 --> 00:42:28,840
How foolishly you rush to your own grave.

496
00:42:33,700 --> 00:42:34,720
My dearest.

497
00:43:24,060 --> 00:43:25,160
I saw it.

498
00:43:26,600 --> 00:43:29,210
You are a bearer of the charm of metta,
which enhances one's virtues.

499
00:43:30,690 --> 00:43:32,160
Yet in the end,

500
00:43:35,020 --> 00:43:36,710
you are nothing
more than a common mortal.

501
00:43:50,040 --> 00:43:51,100
Bulan,

502
00:43:52,610 --> 00:43:54,090
how fortunate you are

503
00:43:55,110 --> 00:43:56,780
to have souls who wish to protect you.

504
00:43:59,320 --> 00:44:00,320
Thong!

505
00:44:05,100 --> 00:44:06,560
If it is death you all crave,

506
00:44:08,000 --> 00:44:10,080
I shall grant your wish to the fullest.

507
00:44:21,720 --> 00:44:22,790
Cease this at once.

508
00:44:23,640 --> 00:44:25,300
If it is Father's sacred arts you seek,

509
00:44:25,710 --> 00:44:26,840
I shall bestow them upon you.

510
00:44:29,050 --> 00:44:30,680
No, my beloved!

511
00:44:31,190 --> 00:44:32,360
Let her go.

512
00:44:32,700 --> 00:44:34,660
This matter is between you and me

513
00:44:35,100 --> 00:44:36,120
alone.

514
00:44:47,800 --> 00:44:49,080
Stop this, my beloved.

515
00:44:56,110 --> 00:44:58,280
Don't do this.

516
00:45:06,410 --> 00:45:09,190
Keep Father's sacred arts
to yourself if you wish,

517
00:45:10,720 --> 00:45:14,300
so that I may crush
the very soul of your karmic soulmate

518
00:45:14,910 --> 00:45:16,710
into dust.

519
00:45:20,700 --> 00:45:22,320
Keep that mouth of yours

520
00:45:22,520 --> 00:45:24,600
ready to scream when you rot in hell.

521
00:45:25,510 --> 00:45:27,990
Though his sacred arts are paramount,

522
00:45:28,750 --> 00:45:31,760
if a life must be sacrificed to preserve them,

523
00:45:32,720 --> 00:45:34,400
I will readily forsake them

524
00:45:34,710 --> 00:45:36,040
for the sake of righteousness.

525
00:45:37,410 --> 00:45:38,690
Of course.

526
00:45:40,410 --> 00:45:42,220
You were always his cherished favorite.

527
00:45:43,510 --> 00:45:45,400
You are the daughter he was truly proud of.

528
00:45:47,860 --> 00:45:51,170
I never curried favor with Father
to inherit his sacred arts, and you know it!

529
00:45:51,190 --> 00:45:53,000
Even so, you got everything anyway:

530
00:45:54,290 --> 00:45:55,400
the sanctum,

531
00:45:56,500 --> 00:45:57,680
the sacred arts,

532
00:45:58,500 --> 00:45:59,820
and the sorcerous tiger.

533
00:46:02,110 --> 00:46:03,420
And what about me?

534
00:46:07,400 --> 00:46:08,630
Why then

535
00:46:12,020 --> 00:46:14,190
was I never once worthy of his pride?

536
00:46:15,110 --> 00:46:16,160
Zai.

537
00:46:16,710 --> 00:46:17,920
Do you even know

538
00:46:18,410 --> 00:46:20,340
what I had to endure?

539
00:46:21,500 --> 00:46:23,800
All the burdens and all the pain.

540
00:46:25,390 --> 00:46:26,210
Very well.

541
00:46:27,110 --> 00:46:28,760
If it is all that you desire,

542
00:46:29,810 --> 00:46:33,000
I shall yield every last bit of it to you.

543
00:46:33,720 --> 00:46:35,240
Spare me your threats.

544
00:46:36,500 --> 00:46:37,500
I know full well

545
00:46:38,800 --> 00:46:40,560
the price that must be paid.

546
00:46:44,330 --> 00:46:45,560
Yet I shall take it,

547
00:46:47,410 --> 00:46:49,000
even if it costs me my very being.

548
00:46:49,880 --> 00:46:50,990
That being so,

549
00:46:51,010 --> 00:46:52,600
take it.

550
00:46:57,080 --> 00:47:06,810
(Incanting)

551
00:47:45,710 --> 00:47:48,190
Come forth, Sacred Master.

552
00:47:49,850 --> 00:47:51,960
Descend and dwell within this vessel.

553
00:48:26,690 --> 00:48:27,690
My beloved...

554
00:48:45,140 --> 00:48:47,560
I make this vow

555
00:48:49,100 --> 00:48:53,560
to the heavens, the earth, and all sacred beings.

556
00:48:55,490 --> 00:48:59,300
If I cannot protect the one I love,

557
00:49:00,520 --> 00:49:03,200
I shall forsake all faith,

558
00:49:04,000 --> 00:49:05,780
cast aside even the law itself,

559
00:49:05,800 --> 00:49:07,720
and turn my back on righteousness.

560
00:49:26,050 --> 00:49:26,760
My beloved...

561
00:49:26,990 --> 00:49:28,000
My beloved.

562
00:49:33,400 --> 00:49:34,900
Tell me you're fine.

563
00:49:35,810 --> 00:49:37,190
I am well.

564
00:49:38,800 --> 00:49:40,320
I am well...

565
00:50:10,490 --> 00:50:13,240
Here shall you both meet your end!

566
00:50:53,610 --> 00:50:54,860
Save me!

567
00:50:59,310 --> 00:51:00,790
His time

568
00:51:01,290 --> 00:51:03,040
has come, has it not?

569
00:51:07,900 --> 00:51:09,690
I bestow this upon you:

570
00:51:11,210 --> 00:51:12,840
my lower garment.

571
00:51:13,900 --> 00:51:15,320
Use this

572
00:51:16,400 --> 00:51:17,840
to put an end to him.

573
00:51:23,000 --> 00:51:24,560
What is going on, my beloved?

574
00:51:25,590 --> 00:51:27,120
Mother's lower garment.

575
00:51:27,990 --> 00:51:30,720
It strips him of all powers.

576
00:51:31,400 --> 00:51:33,440
His flesh writhes in turmoil.

577
00:51:33,600 --> 00:51:36,410
The sacred arts war violently
with his dark sorcery.

578
00:51:53,410 --> 00:51:55,600
If I remain worthy to be

579
00:51:55,620 --> 00:51:58,100
the true keeper of these arts,

580
00:51:59,110 --> 00:52:00,900
let all sacred knowledge

581
00:52:01,620 --> 00:52:03,960
return unto me at once.

582
00:52:29,510 --> 00:52:33,810
If I truly remain worthy to carry this legacy,

583
00:52:34,490 --> 00:52:38,800
let all sacred arts return unto me.

584
00:53:16,600 --> 00:53:17,720
My dearest.

585
00:53:18,110 --> 00:53:19,900
Do open your eyes.

586
00:54:15,000 --> 00:54:15,990
[Inthu Sinthamrong,
deceased: 6 January 2019]

587
00:54:16,010 --> 00:54:17,090
[Chantharametha Kritpirat,
deceased: 4 November 2026]

588
00:54:17,110 --> 00:54:19,600
It is the karma of his boundless desire.

589
00:54:20,800 --> 00:54:23,010
Even his physical form

590
00:54:23,300 --> 00:54:24,800
has burned away into nothingness,

591
00:54:25,500 --> 00:54:27,300
leaving no soul to be blessed.

592
00:54:30,210 --> 00:54:31,800
If it is your wish,

593
00:54:32,000 --> 00:54:34,100
I shall grant him my forgiveness,

594
00:54:34,890 --> 00:54:36,330
for his deeds thus far

595
00:54:36,350 --> 00:54:39,440
have condemned him to eternal torment.

596
00:54:39,610 --> 00:54:41,410
There is no need for us
to harbor any ill will.

597
00:54:45,500 --> 00:54:46,900
From this day forth,

598
00:54:47,610 --> 00:54:49,800
you shall no longer suffer on his account.

599
00:54:52,120 --> 00:54:53,510
All sorrow and grief

600
00:54:54,610 --> 00:54:57,590
shall be no more.

601
00:55:00,700 --> 00:55:03,200
I bestow my blessing upon you both:

602
00:55:04,220 --> 00:55:05,720
walk side by side,

603
00:55:05,910 --> 00:55:07,640
ever guided by mercy,

604
00:55:09,600 --> 00:55:11,180
and may virtue,

605
00:55:11,800 --> 00:55:13,890
mindfulness, and wisdom

606
00:55:14,480 --> 00:55:17,760
lead your steps into tranquility.

607
00:55:18,650 --> 00:55:20,500
May you be karmic soulmates,

608
00:55:20,520 --> 00:55:23,300
blessed with happiness and eternal prosperity.

609
00:55:27,310 --> 00:55:28,700
Thank you, Mother.

610
00:55:33,400 --> 00:55:34,920
From this moment forth,

611
00:55:35,190 --> 00:55:37,110
leave the duty of

612
00:55:38,710 --> 00:55:40,300
watching over Bulan

613
00:55:40,990 --> 00:55:42,490
with me.

614
00:55:44,890 --> 00:55:46,700
With no lingering attachments left behind,

615
00:55:47,190 --> 00:55:51,030
may you pass peacefully into a higher realm.

616
00:55:51,710 --> 00:55:53,600
Rest your heart and be free.

617
00:56:05,720 --> 00:56:07,410
The reason I visited today

618
00:56:07,590 --> 00:56:09,920
is that I wish to apologize
for breaking my oath

619
00:56:13,210 --> 00:56:15,600
and seeing your daughter

620
00:56:18,280 --> 00:56:20,560
before permitted time, madam.

621
00:56:22,310 --> 00:56:24,790
I was the one who went to see her.

622
00:56:25,610 --> 00:56:27,500
Mom, Dad,

623
00:56:27,520 --> 00:56:28,800
if you're gonna be mad,

624
00:56:29,030 --> 00:56:30,490
please do so at me.

625
00:56:31,290 --> 00:56:33,640
Don't blame it on her.

626
00:56:37,710 --> 00:56:39,440
Look how much you love each other.

627
00:56:40,100 --> 00:56:41,560
Jeez, Ratchapee!

628
00:56:41,900 --> 00:56:44,720
When are you gonna stop
getting between them!?

629
00:56:46,290 --> 00:56:47,290
Mother,

630
00:56:47,960 --> 00:56:49,760
we haven't even discussed

631
00:56:49,770 --> 00:56:50,800
