632
00:56:51,000 --> 00:56:53,110
and let Peem leave the hospital

633
00:56:53,120 --> 00:56:54,950
when she was still hurt.

634
00:56:57,410 --> 00:56:58,310
None of your business...

635
00:56:59,040 --> 00:57:00,040
How did she know?

636
00:57:07,390 --> 00:57:10,320
No one's wronged me by breaking an oath.

637
00:57:12,500 --> 00:57:15,180
I was the only one in the wrong

638
00:57:16,640 --> 00:57:20,220
for believing that
my child's life was mine,

639
00:57:21,910 --> 00:57:23,480
when in fact,

640
00:57:24,590 --> 00:57:26,410
her life and heart

641
00:57:28,510 --> 00:57:30,080
belong to her.

642
00:57:31,140 --> 00:57:32,690
As a mother,

643
00:57:32,810 --> 00:57:34,300
whoever my daughter loves,

644
00:57:35,800 --> 00:57:37,800
I should love them, too.

645
00:57:39,520 --> 00:57:41,280
Knowing it's you,

646
00:57:42,910 --> 00:57:45,680
I have nothing to worry about

647
00:57:46,510 --> 00:57:48,100
because you've proven

648
00:57:48,120 --> 00:57:49,920
that you love my daughter

649
00:57:50,110 --> 00:57:52,240
as much as your own life.

650
00:57:53,520 --> 00:57:55,880
And I have no further doubts

651
00:57:56,110 --> 00:57:58,120
about your love for each other.

652
00:58:03,120 --> 00:58:03,810
Right.

653
00:58:04,300 --> 00:58:05,480
Thank you very much.

654
00:58:08,290 --> 00:58:10,000
What happened, Dad?

655
00:58:11,240 --> 00:58:12,790
The hospital gave me a call and said

656
00:58:12,810 --> 00:58:13,960
Phu woke up.

657
01:00:12,000 --> 01:00:12,700
Come on.

658
01:00:13,010 --> 01:00:13,780
- Shrimp.
- Let's ear shwimp.

659
01:00:13,800 --> 01:00:14,520
Priew.

660
01:00:14,540 --> 01:00:15,370
- What?
- Your shrimp, kid.

661
01:00:15,390 --> 01:00:16,540
Get me two cans.

662
01:00:16,720 --> 01:00:17,720
Ugh!,

663
01:00:17,800 --> 01:00:19,520
