I haven't even gotten to eat.

664
01:00:19,540 --> 01:00:20,580
Go, go, go, go.

665
01:00:24,460 --> 01:00:26,910
Have you told the Master about this?

666
01:00:28,170 --> 01:00:28,850
Not yet.

667
01:00:29,190 --> 01:00:31,590
I'm thinking about keeping it a surprise.

668
01:00:31,850 --> 01:00:32,790
So...

669
01:00:32,970 --> 01:00:34,880
I can trust you, right?

670
01:00:34,900 --> 01:00:38,280
You're not leaking
the news to her before I do, right?

671
01:00:38,650 --> 01:00:40,880
On my honor as a police officer,

672
01:00:40,900 --> 01:00:41,680
